    <p>
      <b>Algorithms</b>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>INIT builds inner state from the subsystem specification and schedules inner blocks by phase.</li>
      <li>OUTPUT routes external inputs, runs inner output blocks, and copies external outputs.</li>
      <li>ALGEBRAIC evaluates inner algebraic blocks; UPDATE advances inner update blocks.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
